 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Kinesis API (2013-12-02). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Streams are stored configuration that becomes ACTIVE immediately: no shard, record, sequence number, iterator, consumer or enhanced fan-out exists, and PutRecord, GetRecords, DescribeStream, ListShards and resharding APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. CreateStream needs ShardCount for a provisioned stream or StreamModeDetails ON_DEMAND (stored with 4 open shards); WarmThroughputMiBps is refused. Retention changes accept 24 to 8760 hours without comparing them with the current period. Encryption stores the KMS key identifier without contacting KMS. Name-based tag APIs (AddTagsToStream, RemoveTagsFromStream, ListTagsForStream) are not implemented; use TagResource, UntagResource and ListTagsForResource with the stream ARN.",
  "title": "Amazon Kinesis Data Streams (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2013-12-02"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
